    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Otherworldly Resilience.</strong> You have Resistance to Necrotic, Psychic, or Radiant damage (choose when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Portal Step.</strong> You can spend 15 feet of movement to teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 15 feet of yourself. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus but only once per turn, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
